	"system": {
		"description": "<p>These small, fluffy white bats almost resemble tiny cotton balls with wings and are often seen in groups of a dozen or more. They emit a faint bioluminescent glow that illuminates a space of 5 feet around them as in the @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-spells.Item.bqavvq6ju5ti8hr3]{Light} spell. Because they do not venture very far below ground, the presence of glowbats usually indicates that there is either an entrance to a cave system or, when seen underground, an exit to the surface nearby.</p>",
